            "Officer"
          ],
          "Faction": [
            "Patricians"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Character§Kennel Master": {
        "text": "Councillor.\n\n**A Stringful of Mystery Sausages**: PULSE Command Ability - One friendly character with the Henchman keyword within 3'' recovers 3 lost Life Points. If that character recovers Life Points, it also recovers 1 lost Will Point.\n\n**Expert Trainer**: This character may only use the ORDER or COUNTER Commands on characters with the Henchman keyword. If it does, roll a dice. On a 7+ this Command does not use a Command Point.\n\n**Hunting Hounds**: Friendly Hunting Hounds gain Bodyguard (Faction (Patricians)) while this character is on the board.\n\n**Manhunt**: This character and friendly characters with the Henchman keyword that start their turn in line of sight gain First Strike (2) when charging enemy characters with the Henchman keyword.\n\nRule quirks to implement:\n* Pulse ability heals Henchman and restores Will.\n* Command usage restricted to Henchman keyword with chance for free use.\n* Grants Bodyguard to Hunting Hounds.\n* Grants First Strike (2) to Henchmen charging other Henchmen in LOS.",
        "stats": {
