      "Character§Venetian Noble": {
        "text": "Councillor.\n\n**Murderous Patron**: Any other friendly character that kills an enemy character replenishes 1 Will Point if both are in line of sight to the Venetian Noble.\n\n**The Monster Behind the Mask**: PULSE Command Ability - This character gains +1 to its MOVEMENT, DEXTERITY, and ATTACK until the end of the round. However, it reduces its PROTECTION to 1.\n\nRule quirks to implement:\n* Conditional Will Point replenishment for allies in LOS.\n* Self-buff Pulse that sets PROTECTION to 1.",
