      "Character§Captain of the Guard": {
        "text": "Officer, Soldier.\n\n**Chain of Command**: This character may only use the ORDER or COUNTER Commands on characters with the Soldier keyword.\n\n**Take Aim!**: AURA Command Ability - All friendly characters with the Soldier keyword within 6'' gain Expert Marksman (1) and Expert Offence (1).\n\nRule quirks to implement:\n* Command usage restricted to Soldier keyword.\n* Aura targets Soldier keyword within 6\".",
