      "Character§Seer": {
        "text": "Premonition: Whenever rolling dice for this character, you may re-roll the Destiny Dice.\nSoothsaying: PULSE Command Ability - For every enemy character in line of sight to this character, add a re-roll to your Soothsaying Pool. Until the end of the round, any friendly character may use these re-rolls on any roll this round - one re-roll per dice.\nRule quirks to implement: No rule quirks.",
