      "Character§Exorcist": {
        "text": "Exorcism: When making a Combat action with Divine Touch, if it causes at least 1 Damage, the target loses 1 Will Point. If the target has 0 Will Points remaining, the attack instead does +3 Damage.\nFear the Lord: PULSE Command Ability - Pick 1 enemy character within 6''. Until the end of the round, whenever that character is hit by a Combat action, the attacker gains Fear (-2).\nHelm of Penitence: This character may attempt to Dispel magic spells as if it has Mage (3). In addition, enemy characters may not use Will Points when within 3'' of this character.\nRule quirks to implement: No rule quirks.",
