      "Character§Vagaan Dru": {
        "text": "Use only at the end of this character's activation. This character gains a Guard counter, even if it is in base contact with an enemy or in water.\nWhen enemy characters within 3'' of this character use Will Points, they lose 1 Life Point for every Will Point used. Characters using Frenzied to use Life Points as Will Points would therefore lose 2 Life Points for every Will Point used!\nA character that loses Life Points due to this weapon catches alight! A character that's alight loses 1 Life Point at the end of each of its turns (even if it's in Water), then that character may pay 1 Will Point. If they do, they are no longer alight.\nWhen making a Combat action against a character with 0 Will Points remaining, this character may re-roll all dice, including the Destiny Dice.\nRule quirks to implement: No rule quirks.",
