        "text": "Enemy characters that start a Run/Climb or Jump action within 3'' of this character must pass a Basic MIND roll to move them further 3'' away from this character. When an enemy character disengages from this character, the disengaging character uses its MIND instead of DEXTERITY for its opposed roll. Mindless characters are unaffected by this rule.\nPick one enemy character in line of sight within 12'' and make an Opposed MIND Roll. For every Ace, move that character 2'' horizontally directly towards either this character or the nearest Water (to either character). This movement does not count as charging or disengaging and cannot cause Attacks of Opportunity.\nThis character can make one 0 AP Drown action in each of its turns.\nRule quirks to implement: No rule quirks.",
